<title>UK: Texaco left with first August Brent clocking - trade.</title>
<headline>Texaco left with first August Brent clocking - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude oil was five o' clocked on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load in the August 19-21 period, was clocked to Texaco. This was the first clocking from the August loading schedule, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
